+# 2026-03-11 - deploy key leaked to a public fork
+
+## What happened
+
+The CI deploy token `{{GH_PAT_REVOKED}}` was committed to `publish.yml` and
+pushed to a public fork. GitHub's secret scanner revoked it automatically
+within 90 seconds; we confirmed revocation and rotated it the same hour.
+
+## Why it is quoted here
+
+The token is dead. It is recorded so the audit trail matches the scanner alert.
+
+## Follow-up
+
+Move publish credentials to OIDC so there is no long-lived token to leak.
